  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "探病天团与回忆录玩笑  (Ji Xiu and Bianbian Crash the Ward)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀",
    "bianbian": "边边"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Rival gossip reporters Ji Xiu and Bianbian run straight into each other visiting Chun Yuqiao at the hospital, bicker over who counts as paparazzi, tease Bu Xiaogu about keeping bedside watch, and joke about writing his memoirs. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，你们怎么两个碰上了？来，坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你怎么还跟这种八卦狗仔做朋友啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "布小谷，你怎么还有这种八卦贩子的朋友啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "您胃不好，我给您买了些面包。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这上面不能放东西，我帮你放，吉总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "祝您早日康复！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼天下第一高冷，很有面子才能来探病的，你竟然在这儿陪床，厉害了呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就是同事间的互相帮助，帮忙照顾一下，你们聊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "淳于总，这个直播的事挺厉害啊，都打破电视史了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您让我给你做个采访什么的，我留点资料，以后好给你写个回忆录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你胡说什么呢？这事能瞎说吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，你们怎么两个碰上了？来，坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ms Ji Xiu, how did the two of you bump into each other? Come, have a seat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你怎么还跟这种八卦狗仔做朋友啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why are you still friends with a tabloid paparazzo like him?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "布小谷，你怎么还有这种八卦贩子的朋友啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu, how do you also have a gossip peddler like her for a friend?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "您胃不好，我给您买了些面包。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since your stomach is delicate, I bought some soft bread for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这上面不能放东西，我帮你放，吉总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Things cannot be set on this counter—let me put it away for you, Ms Ji Xiu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "祝您早日康复！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wishing you a speedy recovery!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼天下第一高冷，很有面子才能来探病的，你竟然在这儿陪床，厉害了呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Manta Ray is famously aloof—only big shots even get to visit him, yet here you are keeping bedside watch!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就是同事间的互相帮助，帮忙照顾一下，你们聊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is just colleagues helping one another out—you all go ahead and chat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "淳于总，这个直播的事挺厉害啊，都打破电视史了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, that live storm broadcast was incredible—did it break television history?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您让我给你做个采访什么的，我留点资料，以后好给你写个回忆录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me interview you and save some notes so I can write your memoirs someday.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你胡说什么呢？这事能瞎说吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What nonsense are you babbling? Is that something to joke about?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，你们怎么两个碰上了？来，坐吧。",
